"13" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100346}] :answer-field/id #uuid "9e6f1148-d36b-51bb-99e8-5de0ade3469e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186100341}] :question/id #uuid "d6dc76a2-8ad4-5d9f-970f-746f45e0bc48" :question/math-academy-id "q-70792" :question/problem "Let $Z = XY$. What is the value of $z_{42}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 4 & 0 \\\\ 0 & -1 & 1 \\\\ -5 & 6 & -2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -3 & -2 \\\\ -4 & 0 & -2 \\\\ -5 & 1 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\n?"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186237990 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100872 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92dd864a-8bc0-547c-84c9-ffd562909315" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying Two Matrices When They Are Conformable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "0172af46-e351-502b-aa3a-c62166a7ed72" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ -15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235806} {:answer/id #uuid "12333d71-f54d-5f6e-9e6c-5fc764d2bc80" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 9 \\\\ -15 & 18\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186235924} {:answer/id #uuid "442b8d6f-cd03-5b5a-84f1-23d1ca97ea2f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ 9 & 15\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236256} {:answer/id #uuid "7b37a294-1d3c-567d-bf66-b3920a5fe9a4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}18 & -2 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236585} {:answer/id #uuid "8ce9cddf-2413-5e15-89c7-45b259cab3b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236707}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "8ce9cddf-2413-5e15-89c7-45b259cab3b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236707} :answer-field/id #uuid "a44f4bb4-30a2-5a30-959a-18587874cdc3" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237655}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "53274149-3160-5be4-b6eb-415d49f449f3" :question/math-academy-id "q-1033" :question/problem "If\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$E=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$F=\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nthen $EF=$" :question/worked-solution "Here, $E$ is a $2\\times 4$ matrix and $F$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $4$ columns in $E$ and $4$ rows in $F,$ so $E$ and $F$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{E}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{F}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}={EF}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $EF,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,2=1\\cdot 4+(-2)\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot (-2)+5\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,18=1\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-1)+4\\cdot 1+5\\cdot 2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,15=3\\cdot 4+(-1)\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot (-2)+1\\cdot 0 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 & 4 & 5 \\\\ 3 & -1 & 0 & 1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2 \\\\ -3 & -1 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,9=3\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot (-1)+0\\cdot 1+1\\cdot 2\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$EF=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 18 \\\\ 15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186238011 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100872 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92dd864a-8bc0-547c-84c9-ffd562909315" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying Two Matrices When They Are Conformable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1f7a62ec-13b8-543d-9616-121868053523" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}20 \\\\ 4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236016} {:answer/id #uuid "22e57d49-7fd7-563f-abb5-64190ff4aa02" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}20 & 24 \\\\ 4 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236039} {:answer/id #uuid "24e7f5a9-a414-5f74-91fa-736878205105" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}12 & -24\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236055} {:answer/id #uuid "6b9d6d90-f170-5014-9e02-b7a17b19bb73" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-20 \\\\ -4\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186236497} {:answer/id #uuid "bf7d5586-3d96-5a03-86a4-ba2ed71c39b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}24 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237034}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf7d5586-3d96-5a03-86a4-ba2ed71c39b0" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}24 & 1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237034} :answer-field/id #uuid "c96651e8-d8ed-5375-92a8-7fde59b35ca0" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186237698}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "83b01661-23af-5f73-bcb3-22f2f416f38b" :question/math-academy-id "q-1035" :question/problem "Find $ST$,  if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$T=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $S$ is a $1\\times 4$ matrix and $T$ is a $4\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $4$ columns in $S$ and $4$ rows in $T,$ so $S$ and $T$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{S}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{4}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{T}_{\\boxed{\\text{4}}\\times 2}={ST}_{1\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $ST,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}24 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,24=2\\cdot 1+(-3)\\cdot 0+1\\cdot (-2)+4\\cdot 6 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 & 1 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & -2 \\\\ 0 & 4 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 6 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}24 & 1\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=2\\cdot (-2)+(-3)\\cdot 4+1\\cdot 1+4\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$ST=\\begin{bmatrix}24 & 1\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265743 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100872 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92dd864a-8bc0-547c-84c9-ffd562909315" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying Two Matrices When They Are Conformable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "24d545a5-b2e6-5053-b8b6-37194c5c9aa5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-5 & 6 \\\\ -3 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263315} {:answer/id #uuid "338b8f0e-6e8c-5003-a20f-65d3696dd73a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263448} {:answer/id #uuid "40cea55b-6167-57c5-a2d6-7f87677038d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-9 & 10 \\\\ -5 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263572} {:answer/id #uuid "53864c34-56a3-5553-afb8-033b263dcdea" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 10 \\\\ -6 & 5\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263719} {:answer/id #uuid "d6bc1bd7-12d4-51d7-8d46-edc046b147b4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 10 \\\\ -2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264868}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "338b8f0e-6e8c-5003-a20f-65d3696dd73a" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263448} :answer-field/id #uuid "7f084fe2-5f6e-5af3-b0dc-03f636f5e40e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265467}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "78f7d23e-60ed-507c-b4f6-6101bce65778" :question/math-academy-id "q-129495" :question/problem "Find $AB$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 3$ matrix and $B$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $3$ columns in $A$ and $3$ rows in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-15=2\\cdot (-3)+(-1)\\cdot 6+1\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,3=2\\cdot 2+(-1)\\cdot 5+1\\cdot 4 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-9=1\\cdot (-3)+0\\cdot 6+2\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 1 & 1 \\\\ 1 & 0 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 2 \\\\ 6 & 5 \\\\ -3 & 4\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,10=1\\cdot 2+0\\cdot 5+2\\cdot 4\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$AB=\\begin{bmatrix}-15 & 3 \\\\ -9 & 10\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265744 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100872 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "92dd864a-8bc0-547c-84c9-ffd562909315" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying Two Matrices When They Are Conformable" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "30980b36-8778-5a51-89b8-a81fc027883f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}22 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263413} {:answer/id #uuid "3bd13396-77b3-54fa-8ae9-6c7200fc84bb" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-6 & 12\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263533} {:answer/id #uuid "7e0eeffe-95e5-570e-9c36-aea6b4fd89db" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}15 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264086} {:answer/id #uuid "975b44bb-df10-5292-a437-e855bf7bd551" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}10 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 8\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264299} {:answer/id #uuid "aee8c241-2555-5612-b6c3-afa60e199249" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}12 & 6\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264506}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "30980b36-8778-5a51-89b8-a81fc027883f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}22 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263413} :answer-field/id #uuid "8f5a069b-5bd2-5270-9936-a86902646679" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265502}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "910b9da2-b0da-578c-b6de-5df3df9fdc3f" :question/math-academy-id "q-129496" :question/problem "Find $XY$,  if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$X=\\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$Y=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $X$ is a $1\\times 3$ matrix and $Y$ is a $3\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere are $3$ columns in $X$ and $3$ rows in $Y,$ so $X$ and $Y$ are conformable for multiplication:\n\n$$\n{X}_{1\\times \\boxed{\\text{3}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{Y}_{\\boxed{\\text{3}}\\times 2}={XY}_{1\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $XY,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}22 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,22=5\\cdot 2+(-2)\\cdot (-2)+4\\cdot 2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}5 & -2 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 & 3 \\\\ -2 & 1 \\\\ 2 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}22 & 9\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,9=5\\cdot 3+(-2)\\cdot 1+4\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$XY=\\begin{bmatrix}22 & 9\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265792 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d7d67c6-d54f-5ee1-af59-fd63d6687cfd" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Column-Vector By a Row-Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "e376d53d-27f0-5be2-b35f-f4d91876ada1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264977} {:answer/id #uuid "eb678b62-e5ac-5a34-a142-98bf42189475" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265054} {:answer/id #uuid "f85d4f26-7a1c-53cb-bb4f-7d6a715d2393" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265174} {:answer/id #uuid "fbcf0048-3a05-5c6a-a8a8-728a7671810b" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265204} {:answer/id #uuid "fd313f4f-a74a-5051-a216-9b54910390f2" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -9\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265223}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "eb678b62-e5ac-5a34-a142-98bf42189475" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265054} :answer-field/id #uuid "8ad6ed81-a246-516c-a457-e881158c431f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265493}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "c109d94f-badb-560f-816a-dc72e0193e2a" :question/math-academy-id "q-129961" :question/problem "If\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n</div>\n\nthen $AB=$" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 1$ matrix and $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere is $1$ column in $A$ and $1$ row in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication: \n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-3=-1\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,1=(-1)\\cdot (-1) \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -9 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-9=(-3)\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}-1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,3=(-3)\\cdot (-1)\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$AB=\\begin{bmatrix}-3 & 1 \\\\ -9 & 3\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265828 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100873 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "71ff07eb-2e16-529e-b17c-1bf7cb9703bd" :knowledge-point/title "Finding an Entry of the Product of Two Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "11a9b3cc-7576-59b2-aabd-3e3baec2350f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "8" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263163} {:answer/id #uuid "220549d6-0043-5ea3-afc4-aec900485a3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263301} {:answer/id #uuid "2ba621a6-7f8a-5196-8dc2-e27ffc2bb0d5" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263369} {:answer/id #uuid "c860a24f-7231-5ddb-8c12-1297c7899912" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "5" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264755} {:answer/id #uuid "e89a0dc1-39c3-5234-b0bd-01580a7b5954" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265022}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "e89a0dc1-39c3-5234-b0bd-01580a7b5954" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265022} :answer-field/id #uuid "7b13e3a0-f57b-544f-a120-5165f77a15ba" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265456}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "945d4e42-e131-5958-8aed-5486accd9a01" :question/math-academy-id "q-130111" :question/problem "Let $S=UV.$ What is the value of ${s}_{13}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$U=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$V=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nS=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1 \\\\ 3 & 0 & 4\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & -2 & 3 \\\\ 1 & 3 & -2 \\\\ 10 & 2 & -5\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $1$st row in $U$ by the $3$rd column in $V$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{s}_{13} & =\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -2 \\\\ -5\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =(-2)\\cdot 3+3\\cdot (-2)+(-1)\\cdot (-5) \\\\  & =-6-6+5 \\\\  & =-7.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265831 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100873 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "71ff07eb-2e16-529e-b17c-1bf7cb9703bd" :knowledge-point/title "Finding an Entry of the Product of Two Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "41cfda0a-f144-589a-a43c-f062ef97cc0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263582} {:answer/id #uuid "6754aa3f-9d7e-5ec5-8d62-0bc2e16b1dd9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-12" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263893} {:answer/id #uuid "8692590c-83fe-5fc5-a3dc-acaa0e379556" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "21" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264160} {:answer/id #uuid "cc7c5d22-55ac-5c2e-8365-30562490fd3c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "16" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264790} {:answer/id #uuid "f3ee5f0e-8ece-5209-a013-26fe841fffb9" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "7" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265142}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "41cfda0a-f144-589a-a43c-f062ef97cc0c" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263582} :answer-field/id #uuid "913f5424-fdc7-501c-8672-ca7479ea1e3e" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265506}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "131c2176-2405-5c54-b473-9fb3958cf472" :question/math-academy-id "q-130120" :question/problem "Let $D=AB.$ What is the value of ${d}_{24}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nD=\\begin{bmatrix}-1 & 2 & 4 \\\\ 3 & 4 & -1 \\\\ -1 & 1 & 0 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -7\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 1 & -2 & -3 \\\\ 0 & 4 & -1 & 1 \\\\ 2 & 0 & 3 & -3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row in $A$ by the $4$th column in $B$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{d}_{24} & =\\begin{bmatrix}3 & 4 & -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-3 \\\\ 1 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =3\\cdot (-3)+4\\cdot 1+(-1)\\cdot (-3) \\\\  & =-9+4+3 \\\\  & =-2.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186265857 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d7d67c6-d54f-5ee1-af59-fd63d6687cfd" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Column-Vector By a Row-Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1297b425-ab85-5bba-90d9-0aa321868ad7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}24\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263175} {:answer/id #uuid "3c0c371e-e1b3-52d8-84c6-a9a17f03d267" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}12 & -15 \\\\ -16 & 20 \\\\ 8 & -10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186263534} {:answer/id #uuid "b6e8ab17-e45c-523a-a19c-a71e31ef33d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264584} {:answer/id #uuid "c36d4eae-a73f-53be-a310-030402b0ab31" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}-1\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264705} {:answer/id #uuid "d6eeee6e-2309-557d-bba3-b9d1577e7b86" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\begin{bmatrix}12 & -15 \\\\ 8 & -10\\end{bmatrix}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264871}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "b6e8ab17-e45c-523a-a19c-a71e31ef33d7" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045499 :db/ident :answer.type/text} :answer/value "Undefined" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186264584} :answer-field/id #uuid "cc268ea8-08d4-59b5-9560-41a3fd652f6f" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045493 :db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186265607}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "60c63572-fb04-5890-b3cf-3b16c8ce9cd7" :question/math-academy-id "q-130230" :question/problem "Find $ST$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$S=\\begin{bmatrix}3 \\\\ -4 \\\\ 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$T=\\begin{bmatrix}4 \\\\ -3\\end{bmatrix}.$</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $S$ is $3\\times 1$ matrix and $T$ is a $2\\times 1$ matrix. \n\nThere is $1$ column in $S$ and $2$ rows in $T$, so the product is undefined:\n\n$$\n{S}_{3\\times 1}{\\times }_{\\ne }{T}_{2\\times 1}=\\text{undefined}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292865 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d7d67c6-d54f-5ee1-af59-fd63d6687cfd" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Column-Vector By a Row-Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "5cd20551-e511-5385-ad3b-9f36caad9c32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291027}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "5cd20551-e511-5385-ad3b-9f36caad9c32" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-3" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291027} :answer-field/id #uuid "14870852-5dba-5438-b80f-0294962b94c4" :answer-field/key "field-4" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291808} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "99eb7f75-7610-5e51-a8a8-ea2f0aa74805" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291299}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "99eb7f75-7610-5e51-a8a8-ea2f0aa74805" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "6" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291299} :answer-field/id #uuid "1e8457af-c14e-5585-bda0-1873665d0316" :answer-field/key "field-2" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291849} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "a08af78f-1333-5b89-bfe0-706c792d2caa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291330}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "a08af78f-1333-5b89-bfe0-706c792d2caa" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "-4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291330} :answer-field/id #uuid "875d3970-b055-5c12-a79c-0f111817cb83" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292153} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "36adad61-e1c4-5d23-8fcb-8c6eb215c8d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290856}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "36adad61-e1c4-5d23-8fcb-8c6eb215c8d1" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290856} :answer-field/id #uuid "c1f3e50b-9242-52ef-956e-9a4abeae199b" :answer-field/key "field-3" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292333}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "f1f60738-9f75-548f-8757-47743135ac46" :question/math-academy-id "q-275545" :question/problem "If\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$A=\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$B=\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix},$</div>\n</div>\n\nfind $AB.$\n\n<div class=\"matrix-answer\">\n<span class=\"matrix-answer-label\">$AB=$</span>\n<div class=\"matrix-answer-brackets\">\n<table aria-label=\"Answer matrix\"><tbody>\n<tr><td>{{field-1}}</td><td>{{field-2}}</td></tr>\n<tr><td>{{field-3}}</td><td>{{field-4}}</td></tr>\n</tbody></table>\n</div>\n</div>" :question/worked-solution "Here, $A$ is a $2\\times 1$ matrix and $B$ is a $1\\times 2$ matrix. \n\nThere is $1$ column in $A$ and $1$ row in $B,$ so $A$ and $B$ are conformable for multiplication: \n\n$$\n{A}_{2\\times \\boxed{\\text{1}}}{\\cdot }_{✓}{B}_{\\boxed{\\text{1}}\\times 2}={AB}_{2\\times 2}\n$$\n\nLet's compute $AB,$ one element at a time:\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned} & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & ∗ \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-4=2\\cdot -2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ ∗ & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,6=2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & ∗\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,2=-1\\cdot -2 \\\\  & \\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ -1\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}-2 & 3\\end{bmatrix}=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}, &  & \\,-3=-1\\cdot 3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore, \n$AB=\\begin{bmatrix}-4 & 6 \\\\ 2 & -3\\end{bmatrix}.$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292866 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100873 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "71ff07eb-2e16-529e-b17c-1bf7cb9703bd" :knowledge-point/title "Finding an Entry of the Product of Two Matrices" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "73870312-24b0-5710-9582-ace4d833975f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291128}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "73870312-24b0-5710-9582-ace4d833975f" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "14" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291128} :answer-field/id #uuid "61916db7-9570-5896-8478-8a654eab7267" :answer-field/key "field-1" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292032}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "375c7db7-262a-5420-9a53-a13dd2a5b997" :question/math-academy-id "q-275547" :question/problem "Let $L=MN.$ What is the value of ${l}_{22}$, if\n\n<div class=\"matrix-operands matrix-operands-stacked\">\n<div>$M=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}$</div>\n<div>$N=\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}?$</div>\n</div>\n\n${l}_{22}=$\n{{field-1}}" :question/worked-solution "The full matrix product is\n\n$$\nL=\\begin{bmatrix}2 & -3 \\\\ 4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}1 & 2 & 0 \\\\ -1 & 3 & 3\\end{bmatrix}\n$$\n\nMultiplying the $2$nd row in $M$ by the $2$nd column in $N$, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{l}_{22} & =\\begin{bmatrix}4 & 2\\end{bmatrix}\\begin{bmatrix}2 \\\\ 3\\end{bmatrix} \\\\  & =4\\cdot 2+2\\cdot 3 \\\\  & =8+6 \\\\  & =14.\\end{aligned}\n$$"}] [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186292867 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186100913 :knowledge-point/id #uuid "3d7d67c6-d54f-5ee1-af59-fd63d6687cfd" :knowledge-point/title "Multiplying a Column-Vector By a Row-Vector" :topic/_knowledge-points [{:db/id #edb/ref 17592186050407 :topic/title "Multiplying Matrices"}]}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "3ca215ee-0623-587b-9023-3636cc2853da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290882}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "3ca215ee-0623-587b-9023-3636cc2853da" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "4" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186290882} :answer-field/id #uuid "5bc062b7-2d6b-5f91-84df-fab4dc97bf7f" :answer-field/key "field-6" :answer-field/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045492 :db/ident :answer-field.type/blank} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186292012} {:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "bf79a280-af12-5e3c-8918-f31f6f1692f4" :answer/type {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045498 :db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186291456}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "bf79a280-a